From 10c4793955defb66d1889ab0e1e5f9d5fd8175d6 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <claude@example.com>
Date: Fri, 16 Oct 2026 09:43:12 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Fix accounting engine bugs, remove dead code, streamline UX

- atomic voucher transactions; fix stock never updating from UI (string material_id),
  doubled debtor balance, cash receipts booked to bank, lost supplier payables
- real expenses/loan payments (net profit was always == gross)
- sequential voucher numbers, SKU/party uniqueness, atomic de-duplicated Tally import
- single Layout + shared voucher editor, live Dexie queries, toasts/confirm
- rewritten voucher form; dashboard 'money to collect' / 'running low'
- remove jspdf, framer-motion, AddUserModal, unused assets; en-IN formatting; local dates
